Subject: [PATCH 34/53] Guide: Profile Name (Edit Gamer Profile);
 XamProfileRenameAccount

Edit Gamer Profile's Profile Name (901066C0) opens vk's keyboard titled
"Edit Profile Name" with the gamertag. Done: an unchanged name is accepted
(90106750); otherwise 90115580 checks the text as typed with LiveProfile's
messages. A failure shows XamShowMessageBox(the keyboard's title, the
message, {OK}, error icon) and the keyboard again (90118DF0). Accepted:
XamProfileRenameAccount (90107090) and back to Edit Gamer Profile. B
returns without a change.

XamProfileRenameAccount (xuid, gamertag) is implemented: the account's
gamertag is saved in its Account file and a signed-in profile's copy is
updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AFb8CDFE1Ms5NnJH88eG8b
